      "id": "CR-ING-11-2026-W25-repaso-p3-001-MASTERY-bundle-v1",
      "statement": "Carlos said, \"I have never seen such a beautiful quetzal before.\" What is the correct reported speech for this sentence?",
      "context": "Carlos is describing his recent eco-tour in Monteverde Cloud Forest.",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "Carlos said he has never seen such a beautiful quetzal before.",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Carlos said he has never seen such a bea"
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "Carlos said he had never seen such a beautiful quetzal before.",
          "is_correct": true,
          "feedback": "Correcto! Carlos said he had never seen such a beautiful quetzal befor"
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "Carlos said he never saw such a beautiful quetzal before.",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Carlos said he never saw such a beautifu"
